[stderr] 101:The core exposes typed intent commands such as `StartCampaign`,
[stderr] 102-`ChooseAction`, `UseItem`, `Talk`, `AcceptQuest`, `ClaimReward`,
[stderr] 103-`EnterExit`, `CommitCheckpoint`, `LoadSlot`, and `ApplySettings`. A command
